364
00:38:25,713 --> 00:38:26,713
Sério?

365
00:38:59,503 --> 00:39:00,503
DJ?

366
00:39:05,308 --> 00:39:06,708
Tem alguém na casa.

367
00:39:09,503 --> 00:39:10,603
